OL,3,GNEWSAPrison officer denies faking bomb
OL,4,Athreat at jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison officer is due to stand trial
OL,7,Faccused of faking a bomb threat at HMP
OL,8,FMoorland in Doncaster.
OL,10,FChelsea Welch, 35, of Bilsdale Road,
OL,11,FScunthorpe, is charged with making a
OL,12,Fbomb hoax by communicating false
OL,13,Finformation on 28 July 2025 and
OL,14,Fmisconduct in public office.
OL,16,FShe appeared at Sheffield Crown Court
OL,17,Fearlier and pleaded not guilty to both
OL,18,Fcharges.
OL,20,FWelch was granted bail, with a trial
OL,21,Fdue to start on 8 November 2027.
